    "text": "A trapezium is such that three of its sides have lengths as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then the length (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cm</mi></math>) of the fourth side such that the area of trapezium is maximum, is",
